{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "26409e7c-82da-4576-b86a-3ebfcd64a334",
    "name": "Agrisano Backend - Tareas",
    "description": "Coleccion para probar el modulo de tareas. Importar en Postman, configurar email, password y tenantId, correr Auth / Login y Setup, y ejecutar las carpetas en orden: Tareas, Estados, Reordenamiento, Borrado. El tablero es la combinacion establecimiento + ambito.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Accept', value: 'application/json' });",
          "if (!pm.request.headers.has('Content-Type') && ['POST', 'PATCH', 'PUT'].includes(pm.request.method)) {",
          "  pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Content-Type', value: 'application/json' });",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Login exitoso', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.access_token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.access_token);",
                  "if (json.refresh_token) pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', json.refresh_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-tenant-id",
                "value": "{{tenantId}}",
                "description": "Obligatorio si TENANCY_REQUIRED=true, incluido en el login."
              },
              {
                "key": "x-tenant-key",
                "value": "{{tenantKey}}",
                "description": "Opcional, segun configuracion TENANCY_HEADER.",
                "disabled": true
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Obtiene access_token y refresh_token. El test los guarda en las variables token y refreshToken. Los roles quedan dentro del JWT: si cambian en base, hay que volver a loguearse."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Refresh exitoso', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.be.success;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.access_token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.access_token);",
                  "if (json.refresh_token) pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', json.refresh_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-tenant-id",
                "value": "{{tenantId}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-tenant-key",
                "value": "{{tenantKey}}",
                "disabled": true
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh_token\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "refresh"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Renueva tokens y actualiza variables."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "x-tenant-id",
                "value": "{{tenantId}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-tenant-key",
                "value": "{{tenantKey}}",
                "disabled": true
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Prueba rapida del bearer token."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Setup",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Obtener establecimiento",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Hay establecimientos', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.be.success;",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data).to.be.an('array').that.is.not.empty;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.data && json.data[0] && json.data[0].id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('establecimientoId', json.data[0].id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "x-tenant-id",
                "value": "{{tenantId}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-tenant-key",
                "value": "{{tenantKey}}",
                "disabled": true
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/establecimientos?limit=1",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "establecimientos"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "1"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Guarda el primer establecimiento del tenant en establecimientoId. Correr antes de crear tareas: el tablero es establecimiento + ambito."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener usuario para asignar",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Hay usuarios', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.be.success;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.data && json.data[0] && json.data[0].id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('usuarioId', json.data[0].id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "x-tenant-id",
                "value": "{{tenantId}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-tenant-key",
                "value": "{{tenantKey}}",
                "disabled": true
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users?limit=1",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "users"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "1"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Guarda el primer usuario del tenant en usuarioId, para las pruebas de asignacion."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Tareas",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar ambitos",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Devuelve los ambitos', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.be.success;",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data).to.be.an('array').that.is.not.empty;",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data[0]).to.have.property('value');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data[0]).to.have.property('label');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "x-tenant-id",
                "value": "{{tenantId}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-tenant-key",
                "value": "{{tenantKey}}",
                "disabled": true
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tareas/ambitos",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tareas",
                "ambitos"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Los ambitos disponibles, para que el frontend no los hardcodee. Esta ruta esta declarada antes de /tareas/:id, asi que ambitos nunca se interpreta como un id."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear tarea",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Creada en pendiente', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.estado).to.eql('pendiente');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.orden).to.be.a('number');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.completada_at).to.eql(null);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.data && json.data.id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('tareaId', json.data.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-tenant-id",
                "value": "{{tenantId}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-tenant-key",
                "value": "{{tenantKey}}",
                "disabled": true
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tareas",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tareas"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Requiere rol supervisor o admin_global. Nace en pendiente, con orden = MAX(orden) + 1 del tablero (establecimiento + ambito) y creada_por tomado del token.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"establecimiento_id\": \"{{establecimientoId}}\",\n  \"ambito\": \"{{ambito}}\",\n  \"titulo\": \"{{tituloTarea}}\",\n  \"descripcion\": \"{{descripcionTarea}}\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear tarea con estado en el body (debe fallar)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Rechaza campos no permitidos', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(400);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-tenant-id",
                "value": "{{tenantId}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-tenant-key",
                "value": "{{tenantKey}}",
                "disabled": true
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tareas",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tareas"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Caso negativo: estado y orden los maneja el backend. El ValidationPipe global rechaza cualquier campo no declarado en el DTO.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"establecimiento_id\": \"{{establecimientoId}}\",\n  \"ambito\": \"{{ambito}}\",\n  \"titulo\": \"No deberia crearse\",\n  \"estado\": \"completada\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear tarea con asignado invalido (debe fallar)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Asignado invalido', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(422);",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.error.code).to.eql('TAREA_ASIGNADO_INVALIDO');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-tenant-id",
                "value": "{{tenantId}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-tenant-key",
                "value": "{{tenantKey}}",
                "disabled": true
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tareas",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tareas"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Caso negativo: el asignado tiene que ser un usuario del tenant. Falla antes de abrir la transaccion, asi que no se crea nada.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"establecimiento_id\": \"{{establecimientoId}}\",\n  \"ambito\": \"{{ambito}}\",\n  \"titulo\": \"No deberia crearse\",\n  \"asignado_a_usuario_id\": \"99999999-9999-4999-8999-999999999999\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar tareas",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Respuesta paginada', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.be.success;",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json).to.have.property('ok', true);",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data).to.be.an('array');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.meta).to.have.property('total');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const activas = (json.data || []).filter(function (t) {",
                  "  return t.estado === 'pendiente' || t.estado === 'en_progreso';",
                  "});",
                  "const ids = activas.map(function (t) { return t.id; });",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('tareaIdsJson', JSON.stringify(ids));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('tareaIdsInvertidasJson', JSON.stringify(ids.slice().reverse()));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "x-tenant-id",
                "value": "{{tenantId}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-tenant-key",
                "value": "{{tenantKey}}",
                "disabled": true
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tareas?page={{page}}&limit={{limit}}&establecimiento_id={{establecimientoId}}&ambito={{ambito}}&sortBy={{sortBy}}&sortOrder={{sortOrder}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tareas"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "{{page}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "{{limit}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "establecimiento_id",
                  "value": "{{establecimientoId}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "ambito",
                  "value": "{{ambito}}",
                  "description": "nursery o greenhouse."
                },
                {
                  "key": "estado",
                  "value": "{{tareaEstado}}",
                  "description": "pendiente, en_progreso, completada o cancelada. Vacio no es valido: dejar deshabilitado si no se filtra.",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "asignado_a",
                  "value": "me",
                  "description": "UUID de usuario, o el literal me para el usuario del token.",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "q",
                  "value": "{{search}}",
                  "description": "Busca en titulo y descripcion.",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "sortBy",
                  "value": "{{sortBy}}",
                  "description": "Permitidos: orden, created_at, titulo, estado. Cualquier otro cae a orden."
                },
                {
                  "key": "sortOrder",
                  "value": "{{sortOrder}}",
                  "description": "ASC o DESC."
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lista las tareas no borradas del tenant. El orden por defecto es orden ASC con desempate por id, asi que la paginacion es estable. Para el flujo de reordenamiento conviene subir limit a 200 para que el tablero venga completo."
          }
        },
